# Build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# The PDFium sidecar a dev checkout drops next to the binary; the release
# pipeline fetches its own pinned copy and never commits one. Anchored to the
# repository root on purpose: an unanchored `pdfium*` also swallows
# `src/platform/pdfium.rs`, which is a source file the build needs.
/libpdfium*
/pdfium*

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
